Z||000010||grinthock||06-19-2001||09:12 PM||||ME?  I wash and wax (quick) before the Hamilton Cruise Nights every week, and then once every 2 months I do a complete Mequires 3 Step system.... Although, I have done it twice, but now I do'nt think I need it, that stuff STAYS ON THE CAR A LONG TIME!!!  Works very well and highly reccomended.....  <P>MY weekly (for the car show) is VERY quick because I work 45 minutes before the show so I don't have much time<P>1)  Rinse<BR>2)  Scrub brush<BR>3)  Rinse<BR>4)  Spray Wax<BR>5)  a good 2 minutes of Spot FRee Ionized and softend water all over, this ensures NO spots!!! And the cool thing is I DONT NEED TO DRY THE CAR!! AkursedX can vouch my car looks pretty clean at the show and I do'nt even wipe it clean (When I arrive i clean off whatever is left and get the nitty gritty spots....<P><BR>That's me||||reg||1
