Z||000015||FieroJoe||06-19-2001||10:48 PM||||I wash and completely detail my car at least once a week.  We have a gravel driveway, so the dust really makes my freshly washed car look bad.  I wax it very often, maybe twice a month, and I also sometimes use a glaze before the wax.<P>If the car has fresh wax on it, which is almost all of the time, and it gets dusty, I use Meguiar's Quik Detailer.  You just mist it on, and then wipe away any dust.  Works really good if you need to make your car look freshly washed before a date or a cruise!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
Z||000016||Fformula88||06-19-2001||10:58 PM||||I used to wash about twice a week and get wax on it about once a month.  I'll wash it more in the spring/fall when we get more rain.  <P>Now, I am washing about one time a week and waxing only a couple times a year.  There is just too many cars at my house now to be taken care of (a total of five under my care... no one else ever washes or waxes).  Mine take precedence of course!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
