Z||000018||FieroKyle||06-20-2001||12:34 AM||||I wash my fiero every other day, vacuum it out every 5 days and armor all the interior, wax and polish the car every 2 weeks. I love my fiero and am not sick of doing it yet. Besides my car is black and i live on a dirt road, the two don't make the best combo. <P>Kyle - 85' GT ||||reg||10
