Z||000020||AusFiero||06-20-2001||02:04 AM||||I wash mine only when it needs it. Went 3 months this time around with only dusting it off and removing any pesky bugs with tar and bug remover. <P>Wax I use sparingly, maybe once or twice a year as a large buildup of it really isn't good for paint.<P>Mind you my car rarely gets driven and never goes out in the rain, well exclduing if I strike rain while away at an event or show. It is also stored in a pretty constant temperature with no sunlight at all which helps its preservation.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
